      "content": "yeah. and it's just so much effort to keep pretending. i wake up and i realize i'm just waiting for the next bad thing to happen or for the silence to get even louder. like, what am i even doing? i'm just a ghost in this house now. it feels like the world just keeps spinning and it doesn't even matter if i'm here or not.",
